# env.optional — paid upgrade + enrichment; the skill runs keyless without any of these.
# If APIFY_API_TOKEN is set -> scrape_reviews.py uses Apify review actors (full coverage,
# anti-bot, cost-gated). If not -> keyless Playwright fetch_page.mjs degrade (partial
# coverage). Apify is the recommended path for completeness/reliability.
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Semantic theme clustering at high review volume:
PINECONE_API_KEY
QDRANT_URL
# Residential/Robomotion proxy for the Playwright (fetch_page.mjs) degrade path:
# HTTPS_PROXY
